# Keep every file's line endings exactly as committed.
#
# This fork tracks upstream Riven, and upstream ships a mix of LF and CRLF
# files. Any automatic normalisation rewrites whole files, which turns a
# two-line change into a thousand-line diff and a guaranteed conflict on
# every upstream merge -- db_functions.py drifted to 1144 changed lines that
# way, for 10 lines of real change.
* -text
